---

### Damage Type Guide

| Enemy Faction | Where they appear | Best Ammo |
|---|---|---|
| Guristas (Caldari pirates) | Caldari/Venal space | Scourge (kinetic) + Inferno (thermal) |
| Blood Raiders | Amarr / Delve space | Mjolnir (EM) + Inferno (thermal) |
| Sansha's Nation | Stain / low-sec / incursions | Mjolnir (EM) + Inferno (thermal) |
| Angel Cartel | Heimatar / Curse space | Havoc (explosive) |
| PvP — most targets | Anywhere | Scourge (kinetic) default |

> In missions, your agent will always be in Caldari space — you'll mostly fight Guristas. Use Scourge as default and switch to Inferno for Guristas specifically.

