> ✅ **LD can make:** Raven hull (BPO ~100M NPC — saves ~20M per hull at ME10, worth it if building multiples), all three rigs.

Orbit at 50,000 m. Cruise missiles hit everything at extreme range. Pulse the shield booster when shields drop. HAM launcher handles anything that closes inside cruise range. Cap Circuit rig sustains the booster over long fights.

